Z||000000||JohnF||09-03-2001||07:21 PM||||All interested in a Texas/Oklahoma get-together!  We wouldn't mind having a visitor from any other state either!<P>Mark your calendar for Saturday, Oct. 13, 2001 for a great "see ya" cruise-in located at Southlake Town Center.  Reserved time is 3:00 p.m. to 7:00 p.m.<P>Free access - no judging, no prizes.  No fees!  Just good fun together.  Drive in  park and open up your car for all to see (and photo).<P>Just please let me know you are coming so parking and preparations can be made in advance.  Area is already reserved!||||reg||12
